{"type":"message","id":"43ac1e9a","parentId":"8ce3adcc","timestamp":"2026-03-29T19:28:19.854Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Mon 2026-03-30 03:28 GMT+8] [Subagent Context] You are running as a subagent (depth 1/1). Results auto-announce to your requester; do not busy-poll for status.\n\n[Subagent Task]: 修复 OpenClaw issue #57242：Anthropic Claude reasoning/thinking 内容泄露到 Discord\n\n目标：在 Discord delivery pipeline 中过滤 Anthropic Messages API 返回的 thinking blocks（type: \"thinking\"）\n\n影响：Claude 模型的 reasoning/thinking 内容泄露到 Discord，可能泄露推理过程\n\n可修性：S（在 Discord 发送逻辑中过滤 thinking blocks）\n\n在 /root/.openclaw/workspace/projects/openclaw-pr 执行：\n1. `gh issue view 57242 --json body,comments` 看完整描述\n2. 查找 Discord message formatting/delivery 相关代码\n3. 添加 thinking blocks 过滤逻辑\n4. 运行测试\n\n回报格式：\n- 状态：成功/失败/阻塞\n- 实际改动（diff）：\n- 测试结果：\n直接回 main"}],"timestamp":1774812499837}}
