{"type":"message","id":"224e083c","parentId":"5d52b886","timestamp":"2026-03-29T19:28:53.259Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"这是一个 subagent 任务，目标是修复 OpenClaw issue #57242：Anthropic Claude reasoning/thinking 内容泄露到 Discord。\n\n任务要求：\n1. 在 /root/.openclaw/workspace/projects/openclaw-pr 执行\n2. `gh issue view 57242 --json body,comments` 看完整描述\n3. 查找 Discord message formatting/delivery 相关代码\n4. 添加 thinking blocks 过滤逻辑\n5. 运行测试\n\n回报格式：\n- 状态：成功/失败/阻塞\n- 实际改动\n- 测试结果\n\n先从第 1 步开始，查看 issue 详情。","thinkingSignature":""},{"type":"text","text":"我来修复这个 issue。首先查看完整的 issue 描述。"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_yyn822mc6k5p3f94ilrtb0q1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd /root/.openclaw/workspace/projects/openclaw-pr && gh issue view 57242 --json body,comments"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"arkcode","model":"glm-4.7","usage":{"input":18077,"output":184,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":18261,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774812522719,"responseId":"021774812523523cb7552bf2b2738992c27085ac90ab905ce5989"}}
{"type":"message","id":"c8f46de9","parentId":"224e083c","timestamp":"2026-03-29T19:28:53.797Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_yyn822mc6k5p3f94ilrtb0q1","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"body\":\"## Summary\\n\\nReasoning/thinking content from Anthropic Claude models (Opus 4.6, Sonnet 4.6) leaks to Discord as italicized \\\"Reasoning: ...\\\" text blocks. This was originally reported in #6470 and #24929 (both now closed), but the fixes only addressed Ollama/local models - Anthropic models are still affected.\\n\\n## Steps to reproduce\\n\\n1. Enable reasoning mode (`/reasoning on` or config default)\\n2. Send any message via Discord that triggers extended thinking\\n3. Observe: internal reasoning/thinking blocks appear in the Discord message as italicized text before the actual response\\n\\n## Expected behavior\\n\\nReasoning/thinking content should be stripped before delivery to messaging surfaces (Discord, Telegram, etc.). Only the final assistant response should be visible.\\n\\n## Actual behavior\\n\\nReasoning blocks are rendered as italicized text in Discord messages, exposing internal chain-of-thought to users. Example:\\n\\n> *Reasoning: Let me check the current status of...*\\n>\\n> Here is the actual response.\\n\\n## Environment\\n\\n- **OpenClaw version:** 2026.3.28\\n- **Models affected:** anthropic/claude-opus-4-6, anthropic/claude-sonnet-4-6\\n- **Channel:** Discord\\n- **OS:** macOS 15 (Tahoe), M4 Ultra\\n- **Plugins:** lossless-claw 0.5.2, acpx, discord\\n\\n## Related issues\\n\\n- #6470 (closed - fix targeted Ollama/local models only)\\n- #24929 (closed - same scope)\\n- #25967 (partial fix in 2.23 did not fully resolve)\\n- #45041 (open feature request for output-level filter)\\n- #49438 (open - Chinese report of same issue)\\n\\n## Notes\\n\\nThe Anthropic Messages API returns reasoning in `thinking` blocks which are structurally distinct from `text` blocks. The fix should be straightforward: filter `type: \\\"thinking\\\"` content blocks before passing to the Discord delivery pipeline. The existing fix for Ollama models likely targets `<think>` XML tags in text, which is a different mechanism than Anthropic's structured thinking blocks.\",\"comments\":[]}"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":537,"aggregated":"{\"body\":\"## Summary\\n\\nReasoning/thinking content from Anthropic Claude models (Opus 4.6, Sonnet 4.6) leaks to Discord as italicized \\\"Reasoning: ...\\\" text blocks. This was originally reported in #6470 and #24929 (both now closed), but the fixes only addressed Ollama/local models - Anthropic models are still affected.\\n\\n## Steps to reproduce\\n\\n1. Enable reasoning mode (`/reasoning on` or config default)\\n2. Send any message via Discord that triggers extended thinking\\n3. Observe: internal reasoning/thinking blocks appear in the Discord message as italicized text before the actual response\\n\\n## Expected behavior\\n\\nReasoning/thinking content should be stripped before delivery to messaging surfaces (Discord, Telegram, etc.). Only the final assistant response should be visible.\\n\\n## Actual behavior\\n\\nReasoning blocks are rendered as italicized text in Discord messages, exposing internal chain-of-thought to users. Example:\\n\\n> *Reasoning: Let me check the current status of...*\\n>\\n> Here is the actual response.\\n\\n## Environment\\n\\n- **OpenClaw version:** 2026.3.28\\n- **Models affected:** anthropic/claude-opus-4-6, anthropic/claude-sonnet-4-6\\n- **Channel:** Discord\\n- **OS:** macOS 15 (Tahoe), M4 Ultra\\n- **Plugins:** lossless-claw 0.5.2, acpx, discord\\n\\n## Related issues\\n\\n- #6470 (closed - fix targeted Ollama/local models only)\\n- #24929 (closed - same scope)\\n- #25967 (partial fix in 2.23 did not fully resolve)\\n- #45041 (open feature request for output-level filter)\\n- #49438 (open - Chinese report of same issue)\\n\\n## Notes\\n\\nThe Anthropic Messages API returns reasoning in `thinking` blocks which are structurally distinct from `text` blocks. The fix should be straightforward: filter `type: \\\"thinking\\\"` content blocks before passing to the Discord delivery pipeline. The existing fix for Ollama models likely targets `<think>` XML tags in text, which is a different mechanism than Anthropic's structured thinking blocks.\",\"comments\":[]}","cwd":"/root/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1774812533797}}
{"type":"message","id":"ca4a1b19","parentId":"c8f46de9","timestamp":"2026-03-29T19:29:02.395Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"好的，我看到了 issue 详情。问题是：\n\n1. **问题**：Anthropic Claude 模型（Opus 4.6, Sonnet 4.6）的 reasoning/thinking 内容泄露到 Discord\n2. **原因**：Anthropic Messages API 返回的 `thinking` blocks（type: \"thinking\"）没有被过滤\n3. **期望行为**：reasoning/thinking 内容应该在发送到 Discord 之前被移除\n4. **实际行为**：thinking blocks 以斜体文本形式显示在 Discord 消息中\n\n现在需要找到 Discord message formatting/delivery 相关代码。我需要：\n1. 查找 Discord 相关的代码\n2. 找到消息格式化/发送的地方\n3. 添加 thinking blocks 过滤逻辑\n\n让我先看看项目结构，找到 Discord 相关代码。","thinkingSignature":""},{"type":"text","text":"好的，看到问题了。Anthropic Claude 模型的 `thinking` blocks（type: \"thinking\"）没有被过滤，导致推理过程泄露到 Discord。\n\n现在查找 Discord 相关代码："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_ci56vexvmsw4xqc4ijzhpbxe","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd /root/.openclaw/workspace/projects/openclaw-pr && find . -type f -name \"*.ts\" -o -name \"*.js\" | xargs grep -l \"discord\" | head -20"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"arkcode","model":"glm-4.7","usage":{"input":18765,"output":264,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":19029,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774812533798,"responseId":"021774812533966cb7552bf2b2738992c27085ac90ab905b81362"}}
