{"type":"message","id":"aaa00c55","parentId":"0cbe8428","timestamp":"2026-03-29T19:31:41.033Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_nwat5htk68bd0f63c1d96ltc","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"import type { AgentMessage } from \"@mariozechner/pi-agent-core\";\n\ntype AssistantContentBlock = Extract<AgentMessage, { role: \"assistant\" }>[\"content\"][number];\ntype AssistantMessage = Extract<AgentMessage, { role: \"assistant\" }>;\n\nexport function isAssistantMessageWithContent(message: AgentMessage): message is AssistantMessage {\n  return (\n    !!message &&\n    typeof message === \"object\" &&\n    message.role === \"assistant\" &&\n    Array.isArray(message.content)\n  );\n}\n\n/**\n * Strip all `type: \"thinking\"` content blocks from assistant messages.\n *\n * If an assistant message becomes empty after stripping, it is replaced with\n * a synthetic `{ type: \"text\", text: \"\" }` block to preserve turn structure\n * (some providers require strict user/assistant alternation).\n *\n * Returns the original array reference when nothing was changed (callers can\n * use reference equality to skip downstream work).\n */\nexport function dropThinkingBlocks(messages: AgentMessage[]): AgentMessage[] {\n  let touched = false;\n  const out: AgentMessage[] = [];\n  for (const msg of messages) {\n    if (!isAssistantMessageWithContent(msg)) {\n      out.push(msg);\n      continue;\n    }\n    const nextContent: AssistantContentBlock[] = [];\n    let changed = false;\n    for (const block of msg.content) {\n      if (block && typeof block === \"object\" && (block as { type?: unknown }).type === \"thinking\") {\n        touched = true;\n        changed = true;\n        continue;\n      }\n      nextContent.push(block);\n    }\n    if (!changed) {\n      out.push(msg);\n      continue;\n    }\n    // Preserve the assistant turn even if all blocks were thinking-only.\n    const content =\n      nextContent.length > 0 ? nextContent : [{ type: \"text\", text: \"\" } as AssistantContentBlock];\n    out.push({ ...msg, content });\n  }\n  return touched ? out : messages;\n}\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1774812701032}}
{"type":"message","id":"46b1cea9","parentId":"aaa00c55","timestamp":"2026-03-29T19:31:50.119Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"好的，我找到了一个 `dropThinkingBlocks` 函数，这个函数可以从 assistant messages 中过滤掉 `type: \"thinking\"` 的内容块。\n\n这个函数的逻辑是：\n1. 遍历所有消息\n2. 对于每个 assistant 消息，检查其 content 数组\n3. 过滤掉 `type === \"thinking\"` 的 blocks\n4. 如果过滤后 assistant 消息为空，则用一个空的 text block 来保持消息结构\n5. 返回过滤后的消息数组\n\n现在问题是：这个函数是在哪里被调用的？它是被调用来过滤发送到 Discord 的内容的吗？\n\n让我搜索一下 `dropThinkingBlocks` 的调用位置。","thinkingSignature":""},{"type":"text","text":"找到了！`dropThinkingBlocks` 函数专门用于过滤 `type: \"thinking\"` 的内容块。现在我需要看看这个函数在哪里被调用在哪里被调用："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_pwgqa7wazlkki2lcq4v5tlr8","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd /root/.openclaw/workspace/projects/openclaw-pr && grep -r \"dropThinkingBlocks\" --include=\"*.ts\" src/ | head -20"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"arkcode","model":"glm-4.7","usage":{"input":31295,"output":217,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":31512,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774812701034,"responseId":"021774812701232cb7552bf2b2738992c27085ac90ab90516a7dc"}}
