{"type":"message","id":"a61e17e9","parentId":"bc541659","timestamp":"2026-03-29T20:28:49.841Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"完美！我成功修复了问题。现在让我总结一下修改并报告结果给 main agent。\n\n修改总结：\n\n**实际改动：**\n\n1. **`extensions/discord/src/monitor/reply-delivery.ts`**：\n   - 在 `deliverDiscordReply` 函数的 for 循环中添加了 `isReasoning` payloads 过滤逻辑\n   - 当 `payload.isReasoning === true` 时，跳过该 payload，不发送到 Discord\n   - 添加了注释说明这个修改的原因和 issue 引用\n\n2. **`extensions/discord/src/monitor/reply-delivery.test.ts`**：\n   - 添加了测试用例 \"suppresses isReasoning payloads from delivery\"\n   - 验证当传递包含 `isReasoning: true` 的 payload 时，它不会被发送到 Discord\n\n**测试结果：**\n- 所有测试通过（20 个测试，包括新添加的测试用例）\n- 新测试用例 \"suppresses isReasoning payloads from delivery\" 通过，验证了修复的有效性\n\n**状态：成功**\n\n现在让我用要求的格式向 main agent 报告结果。","thinkingSignature":""},{"type":"text","text":"完美！我成功修复了问题。\n\n## 修复完成报告\n\n**状态：成功**\n\n**实际改动（diff）：**\n\n```diff\ndiff --git a/extensions/discord/src/monitor/reply-delivery.test.ts b/extensions/discord/src/monitor/reply-delivery.test.ts\nindex 54f49129c3..12190b09e6 100644\n--- a/extensions/discord/src/monitor/reply-delivery.test.ts\n+++ b/extensions/discord/src/monitor/reply-delivery.test.ts\n@@ -520,4 +520,25 @@ describe(\"deliverDiscordReply\", () => {\n       expect.objectContaining({ token: \"token\", accountId: \"default\" }),\n     );\n   });\n+\n+  it(\"suppresses isReasoning payloads from delivery\", async () => {\n+    await deliverDiscordReply({\n+      replies: [\n+        { text: \"Reasoning:\\n_step_\", isReasoning: true },\n+        { text: \"Actual response\" },\n+      ],\n+      target: \"channel:123\",\n+      token: \"token\",\n+      runtime,\n+      cfg,\n+      textLimit: 2000,\n+    });\n+\n+    expect(sendMessageDiscordMock).toHaveBeenCalledTimes(1);\n+    expect(sendMessageDiscordMock).toHaveBeenCalledWith(\n+      \"channel:123\",\n+      \"Actual response\",\n+      expect.objectContaining({ token: \"token\" }),\n+    );\n+  });\n });\ndiff --git a/extensions/discord/src/monitor/reply-delivery.ts b/extensions/discord/src/monitor/reply-delivery.ts\nindex 6289566000..e4e8428603 100644\n--- a/extensions/discord/src/monitor/reply-delivery.ts\n+++ b/extensions/discord/src/monitor/reply-delivery.ts\n@@ -269,6 +269,12 @@ export async function deliverDiscordReply(params: {\n     : undefined;\n   let deliveredAny = false;\n   for (const payload of params.replies) {\n+    // Suppress reasoning payloads from Discord delivery to prevent\n+    // Anthropic Claude thinking blocks from leaking to Discord.\n+    // Ref: https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/issues/57242\n+    if (payload.isReasoning === true) {\n+      continue;\n+    }\n     const tableMode = params.tableMode ?? \"code\";\n     const reply = resolveSendableOutboundReplyParts(payload, {\n       text: convertMarkdownTables(payload.text ?? \"\", tableMode),\n```\n\n**测试结果：**\n- ✅ 所有 20 个测试通过\n- ✅ 新测试用例 \"suppresses isReasoning payloads from delivery\" 通过\n- ✅ 验证了 `isReasoning: true` 的 payloads 被正确过滤，不会发送到 Discord\n\n**修复说明：**\n\n问题根因：`deliverDiscordReply` 函数在遍历 `params.replies` 时，没有过滤掉 `isReasoning` 为 true 的 payloads，导致 Anthropic Claude 模型的 reasoning/thinking 内容泄露到 Discord。\n\n修复方案：在 `deliverDiscordReply` 函数中添加过滤逻辑，当 `payload.isReasoning === true` 时跳过该 payload，防止 thinking blocks 被发送到 Discord。这与 `dispatch-from-config.ts` 中其他 channel 的过滤逻辑保持一致。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"arkcode","model":"glm-4.7","usage":{"input":80112,"output":946,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":81058,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774816067030,"responseId":"021774816075696c7ba22cbcbef0b3ad5a364f1d5ffd4d5f071e9"}}
